// ---- กราฟแนวโน้มแยกราย metric — วาด SVG เอง (ไม่มี chart library ใน sandbox ของ vue-ui) ----
s.svgLineChart = (series, labels, unit) => {
  const W = 500, H = 130, padL = 34, padR = 10, padT = 10, padB = 20
  const innerW = W - padL - padR, innerH = H - padT - padB
  const vals = series.reduce((a, sr) => a.concat(sr.values.filter((v) => v != null)), [])
  if (!vals.length) return '<div style="text-align:center;padding:16px;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);font-size:13px;">ยังไม่มีข้อมูล</div>'
  let min = Math.min(...vals), max = Math.max(...vals)
  if (min === max) { min -= 1; max += 1 }
  const pad = (max - min) * 0.15
  min -= pad; max += pad
  const n = labels.length
  const xAt = (i) => padL + (n <= 1 ? innerW / 2 : (innerW * i) / (n - 1))
  const yAt = (v) => padT + innerH - ((v - min) / (max - min)) * innerH
  let svg = '<svg viewBox="0 0 ' + W + ' ' + H + '" style="width:100%;height:' + H + 'px;display:block;">'
  for (let g = 0; g < 3; g++) {
    const gy = padT + (innerH * g) / 2
    const gv = (max - ((max - min) * g) / 2).toFixed(1)
    svg += '<line x1="' + padL + '" y1="' + gy + '" x2="' + (W - padR) + '" y2="' + gy + '" stroke="var(--el-border-color-lighter)" stroke-width="1"/>'
    svg += '<text x="2" y="' + (gy + 3) + '" font-size="9" fill="var(--el-text-color-secondary)">' + gv + '</text>'
  }
  labels.forEach((lb, i) => {
    if (n > 1 && i % Math.ceil(n / 6) !== 0 && i !== n - 1) return
    svg += '<text x="' + xAt(i) + '" y="' + (H - 4) + '" font-size="9" fill="var(--el-text-color-secondary)" text-anchor="middle">' + lb + '</text>'
  })
  series.forEach((sr) => {
    const segs = []
    let cur = []
    sr.values.forEach((v, i) => {
      if (v == null) { if (cur.length) { segs.push(cur); cur = [] } return }
      cur.push(xAt(i) + ',' + yAt(v))
    })
    if (cur.length) segs.push(cur)
    segs.forEach((seg) => { svg += '<polyline points="' + seg.join(' ') + '" fill="none" stroke="' + sr.color + '" stroke-width="2"/>' })
    sr.values.forEach((v, i) => {
      if (v == null) return
      svg += '<circle cx="' + xAt(i) + '" cy="' + yAt(v) + '" r="3" fill="' + sr.color + '"><title>' + sr.name + ': ' + v + (unit || '') + '</title></circle>'
    })
  })
  svg += '</svg>'
  return svg
}
